Package: minimax-code
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: minimax-code-linux contributors <maintainers@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/xlzhen-940218/minimax-code-linux-arm64
Depends: libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libnss3, libasound2 | libasound2t64, libxss1,
 libgbm1, libdrm2, libxkbcommon0, libatk-bridge2.0-0 | libatk-bridge2.0-0t64,
 libcups2 | libcups2t64, libxdamage1, libxcomposite1, libxrandr2, libx11-xcb1,
 libpango-1.0-0 | libpango-1.0-0t64, libcairo2
Recommends: xdg-utils
Description: MiniMax Code desktop client (unofficial Linux build)
 An unofficial Linux build of the MiniMax Code desktop client, produced by
 repackaging the official Windows application with the matching Electron
 Linux runtime and native modules.
 .
 This package is not published or supported by MiniMax. MiniMax Code itself
 remains proprietary software and is subject to MiniMax's terms of service.
